law.text:
		Approved course providers shall:

Provide to each participant who successfully completes the required recertification course a certificate providing, at a minimum, (i) the name of the provider, (ii) name of the participant, and (iii) the date of completion;


Maintain all records on courses and participants for a period of five years and make those records available to the Board upon request;


Enter the names of participants completing the course into a database as directed by the Board within five days of the participant's completion of the course; and


Collect the recertification application fee from applicants and transmit such fee to the Board as directed by the Board within 15 days of receiving the fee from the applicant.
